{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>And it came to pass after the plague, etc.</b> A parable: to a shepherd into whose flock wolves entered and killed some of them, and he counts them to know the number of those remaining. Another matter: when they came out of Egypt and were handed over to Moses, they were handed over to him by count; now that he drew near to die and to return his flock, he returns them by count (Tanchuma)."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:12:47.692131922Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}